    "detailed_description": "Multiplayer Shooters<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA fast paced shooter game with lots of different game modes and weapons<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMultiplayer or Single Player<br />\r\nA.I. Bots (If You want them)<br />\r\nFirst or Third person view<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSeveral different game modes - <br />\r\nSearch &amp; Destroy<br />\r\nConquest<br />\r\nKill Confirmed<br />\r\nRush<br />\r\nTeam Deathmatch<br />\r\nCapture the Flag<br />\r\nFree for All<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSeveral unique weapons -<br />\r\nAssault Rifle<br />\r\nSMG<br />\r\nShotgun<br />\r\nMachinegun<br />\r\nSniperRifle<br />\r\nPistol<br />\r\nKnife<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDynamic Crosshair<br />\r\nLeaning<br />\r\nWeapon Sway<br />\r\nEquippable Knife and grenade<br />\r\nFire modes (BURST, AUTO &amp; SEMI)<br />\r\nMinimap<br />\r\nKillstreaks<br />\r\nCompass<br />\r\nKill feed<br />\r\nGlobal/Team Chat<br />\r\nClaymore and grenades<br />\r\nRecoil &amp; Breathing System<br />\r\nSniper Scope<br />\r\nHit marker<br />\r\nMelee<br />\r\nClass &amp; Perk selection<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMenus -<br />\r\nMain Menu<br />\r\nHost/Join session<br />\r\nGraphics, Sound, Keybinds &amp; mouse settings<br />\r\n<br />\r\nand much more\u2026",
